# Static Assets

Design-permanent assets live under Astro `public/`:

```text
public/
├── images/
├── videos/
├── fonts/
└── icons/
```

- Examples: logo, favicon, fonts, hero graphics/images/videos/posters, illustrations, decorative graphics, icons, fixed page imagery.
- Choose formats by asset: SVG for vectors; WebP/AVIF when suitable; PNG for needed transparency/lossless; JPEG when appropriate; WebM/MP4 for video.
- Do not blindly convert everything to WebP; do not optimize until quality visibly suffers.

## Hero video (when design uses one)

- Treat as a static site asset when part of the fixed design.
- Prefer WebM; MP4 fallback when useful; always provide a poster.
- Background-style: `muted` `autoplay` `loop` `playsinline` as appropriate.
- Keep files web-sized; do not host fixed hero video in WordPress unless requested.
